  "term": "sham surgery",
  "definition": "In this study, sham surgery refers to the comparison surgical condition used as a control when assessing the behavioral and cognitive effects of tMCAO. It serves as the baseline group for judging whether the experimental surgery led to added deficits or brain changes.",
